msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "What do you think of Kushieda?"
msgstr "¿Qué opinas de Kushieda?"

msgid "What have I told you about Kushieda?"
msgstr "¿Qué te he contado de Kushieda?"

msgid "I hope her hair's okay"
msgstr "Espero que su cabello esté bien"

msgid "About Bye-Bye Birdy"
msgstr "Sobre Adiós, Pajarito"

msgid "I need to hurry and return that book"
msgstr "Debo apurarme a devolver ese libro"

msgid "It was useful after all, huh......?"
msgstr "Al final fue útil, ¿eh......?"

msgid "I'll borrow another cookbook while I'm at it"
msgstr "De paso pediré otro libro de cocina"

msgid "About Love"
msgstr "Sobre el amor"

msgid "Do you love anyone?"
msgstr "¿Amas a alguien?"

msgid "I wonder what it was like being in love"
msgstr "Me pregunto cómo era estar enamorado"

msgid "\"Like\" and \"love\" are only 2 letters apart"
msgstr "\"Gustar\" y \"amar\" están a solo un paso"

msgid "About Kawashima"
msgstr "Sobre Kawashima"

msgid "She's so pretty, no wonder she's a model"
msgstr "Es tan preciosa, con razón es modelo"

msgid "She says I used to have painful memories"
msgstr "Dice que antes tuve recuerdos dolorosos"

msgid "Her family goes to Hawaii for New Year's"
msgstr "Su familia va a Hawái en Año Nuevo"

msgid "About Luxure"
msgstr "Sobre Luxure"

msgid "While I'm gone, take care of Yasuko"
msgstr "Mientras no estoy, cuida a Yasuko"

msgid "Its name is pretty straightforward"
msgstr "Su nombre es bastante directo"

msgid "I'm curious about the sauna"
msgstr "Me da curiosidad la sauna"

msgid "--Let's Calm Inko-chan Down!--"
msgstr "--¡Calmemos a Inko-chan!--"

msgid "Inko-chan「HOT! BURN! ROASTING!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡CALIENTE! ¡QUEMA! ¡¡ASÁNDOSE!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like I said, I won't make oyakodon out＿of you...... Ugh, it's no use. You aren't＿listening to me at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya te dije que no haré oyakodon＿contigo...... Uf, no sirve de nada.＿No me escuchas en absoluto.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「FRIII! FREE!! FRIIIIII!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡FRIII! ¡FRÍO!! ¡FRIIIIII!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? What? Are you trying to say＿fridge? Or freeze......? Crap, it's so＿worked up it can't hear me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? ¿Qué? ¿Intentas decir frío? ¿O＿congelador......? Rayos, está tan＿alterado que no me escucha.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......WHA?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿QUÉ?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry, Inko-chan. I was admiring＿your lovely face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón, Inko-chan. Estaba＿admirando tu linda cara.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HMMMM......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「MMMMM......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, maybe fake compliments won't＿work after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, tal vez los cumplidos falsos＿no funcionen después de todo.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HEY HEY HEEEY!! HEY-HO!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡EY, EY, EEEY!! ¡EY-HO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh god...... Are you turning into＿Kushieda!? Calm down, Inko-chan!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por Dios...... ¡¿Te estás convirtiendo＿en Kushieda?! ¡¡Cálmate, Inko-chan!!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GOOD......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「BUENA......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's right, she's a good girl. But it's＿hard to tell whether I have romantic＿feelings for her......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así es, es una buena chica. Pero＿cuesta saber si tengo sentimientos＿románticos por ella......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「L, LO, LOVE」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「A, A, AMOR」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Love!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Amor?!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「L, LO, DO, DON'T, ASK ME!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「A, A, ¡NO, NO ME, PREGUNTES!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HURKK......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡AGHKK......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoa, sorry for reminding you! Fight＿the urge, Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Uah, perdón por recordártelo! ¡Aguanta＿las ganas, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......GO」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......VE」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......USE, FUL? USEFUL? USEFUL!?!?!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿Ú, TIL? ¿ÚTIL? ¡¿¡¿ÚTIL?!?!?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Useful\"? Were you asking me or＿agreeing with me? Hey, Inko-chan......＿Awww, I sent it into a panic.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Útil\"? ¿Me estabas preguntando o＿dándome la razón? Oye, Inko-chan......＿Ay, lo hice entrar en pánico.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DI, DIV, DIVINE, RETRIBUTIOOOON!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡CA, CAS, CASTIGO, DIVINOOOO!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Calm down, Inko-chan! I'll get a＿cookbook that isn't about chicken!＿Ugh, it's no use. It's totally flipping out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cálmate, Inko-chan! ¡Buscaré un libro＿de cocina que no sea de pollo! Uf, es＿inútil. Se volvió loco del todo.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「LOVE! LOVE LOVE! LOOOOVE LOVE!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡AMOR! ¡AMOR, AMOR! ¡AAAMOR, AMOR!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you getting to the age where you＿yearn for love......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya estás llegando a la edad en＿que anhelas el amor......?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......WHA......?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿QUÉ......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess that's a little too complicated＿for you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que eso es un poco＿complicado para ti.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......BE, BING?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿VI, VIPÍ?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「LOVE! LOVE, LOOOOVE! FREEEEEAK!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡AMOR! ¡AMOR, AMOOOOR! ¡RARITOOO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it seems I struck a chord with you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, parece que toqué una fibra sensible.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......SO?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿Y QUÉ?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, I wasn't trying to make a joke or＿anything...... Sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, no intentaba hacer ningún＿chiste ni nada...... ¡Perdón!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MO, MO, MO, DEL!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡MO, MO, MO, DELO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yep, she's a model.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sip, es modelo.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MO, MO, MO, TEL!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡MO, MO, MO, TEL!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Motel and model are only one letter＿apart. You're so smart, Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Motel y modelo solo cambian en un par de＿letras. ¡Qué listo eres, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「P, P...... PISSY?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿P, P...... PESADA?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Inko-chan, the word is \"pretty\". Then＿again, Kawashima DOES get pissy＿sometimes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Inko-chan, la palabra es \"preciosa\".＿Aunque bueno, Kawashima SÍ se＿pone pesada a veces.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......WHAT...... YOU DO?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿QUÉ...... HARÁS?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What will I do......? Even if they're＿painful, I want to remember them.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué haré......? Aunque sean dolorosos,＿quiero recordarlos.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「JE...... JE, JEAL......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「CE...... CE, CELO......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait, Inko-chan, don't tell me you're＿jealous! Having you and Yasuko here is＿enough for me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Espera, Inko-chan, ¡no me digas＿que estás celoso! ¡Con tenerte a＿ti y a Yasuko aquí me basta!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GEL...... US......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「CIELO...... OSO......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I do not know how to interpret that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No sé cómo interpretar eso......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「OKAY, OKAY」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「OKEY, OKEY」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I knew I could count on you! You're＿amazing, Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, sabía que podía contar contigo!＿¡Eres increíble, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「OH, NO, EW, OKAY」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「OH, NO, IGH, OKEY」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......GO」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......VE」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, are you saying I should stop＿worrying and just go?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿me estás diciendo que deje de＿preocuparme y simplemente vaya?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......VERTI, GO!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¡VE, VÉRTIGO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Okay, whatever.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, como sea.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「LUCK～...... UGGGH!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡LUUUK～...... UUUURGH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No no, it's \"Luxure.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no, es \"Luxure\".」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MIXTURE......?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿MIXTURA......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not \"mixture\"...... Well, close enough,＿I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no \"mixtura\"...... Bueno,＿bastante cerca, supongo.」"

